From: Harvi654 <202698022+Harvi654@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] urlmon: Copy the terminating null with the URL in map_url_to_zone.

AI-assisted (Claude), original code; LGPL-2.1-or-later. Not submitted
upstream.

Before CreateUri reads the copy (AutoCAD's ribbon icons failed at
random). The read past the buffer is not observable through the API;
L3 only by the maintainer's decision of 2026-11-11.

Header added on 2026-11-11, before winum-11.20-1 (the patch body is
unchanged). Problem, cause, Windows behaviour and validation:
docs/patches/urlmon-maptozone-null-terminate.md.

--- a/dlls/urlmon/sec_mgr.c
+++ b/dlls/urlmon/sec_mgr.c
@@ -564,7 +564,8 @@
 
     hres = CoInternetGetSecurityUrl(url, &secur_url, PSU_SECURITY_URL_ONLY, 0);
     if(hres != S_OK) {
-        DWORD size = lstrlenW(url)*sizeof(WCHAR);
+        /* Copy the terminating null too: CreateUri() below reads to it. */
+        DWORD size = (lstrlenW(url)+1)*sizeof(WCHAR);
 
         secur_url = CoTaskMemAlloc(size);
         if(!secur_url)
